     H***TEXT:Cutoff driver - allocate all open orders
     H*
     H* OE011  - NIGHTLY CUTOFF DRIVER                  DKOWALSKI  04/02/98
     H* CALLED BY ORDCUTOF WITH THE DELIVERY DATE (YYMMDD).
     H* CALLS OE010 FOR EVERY OPEN ORDER ON THAT DATE.
     H*
     FORDHDRL1IF  E           K        DISK
     I* NUMERIC FILE FIELDS ARE PACKED INSIDE THE PROGRAM. OE010 WANTS A ZONED
     I* ORDER NUMBER, SO IT GOES THROUGH A DS BEFORE THE CALL.     DK 04/02/98
     IPDATED      DS
     I                                        1   60WDLVDT
     IPORDD       DS
     I                                        1   70WORDNO
     C           *ENTRY    PLIST
     C                     PARM           PDATED
     C           HDKEY     KLIST
     C                     KFLD           WDLVDT
     C           HDKEY     SETLLORDHDRL1
     C           HDKEY     READEORDHDRL1                 80
     C           *IN80     DOWEQ'0'
     C           OSTAT     IFEQ 'O'
     C                     Z-ADDORDNO     WORDNO
     C                     CALL 'OE010'
     C                     PARM           PORDD
     C                     END
     C           HDKEY     READEORDHDRL1                 80
     C                     END
     C                     SETON                     LR
     C                     RETRN
